title: v5.38.1 — publish hygiene cleanup + v6 architect spec drafted
summary: 'Shipped v5.38.1 as the last release before v6.0. Cleanup bundle from the 2026-04-22 post-publish audit: logger exports-condition ordering fix (types now first — esbuild was warning), 4 stray tsup artifacts removed from paradigm-mcp/src/utils/ with scoped root .gitignore preventing future leakage, root .next/ gitignored, @types/node aligned to ^22 across 10 packages, 5 broken README doc link trailers removed. Logger gets independent patch bump (3.5.1 → 3.5.2). Separately: architect drafted v6.0 Medium+ builder-ready spec (700 lines, ~65h / 8 working days, fits May 1 with 1-day margin, escape hatch defers PLSAT migration to v6.0.1 if needed). Multi-tenant University with pack.yaml manifest + CLI selectors + PLSAT migration + decision-store consolidation + loadPortalConfigLegacy removal + privacy-preserving local metrics. 8 user decisions gate builder start on sub-phase 2.'
